ber}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/deployments","created_at":"2012-09-06T00:04:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T01:23:29Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-08T14:21:53Z","git_url":"git://github.com/g-truc/glm.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:g-truc/glm.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm","homepage":"https://glm.g-truc.net","size":74759,"stargazers_count":10499,"watchers_count":10499,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":2317,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":108,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cpp","cpp-library","glm","header-only","mathematics","matrix","opengl","quaternion","simd","sycl","vector","vulkan"],"visibility":"public","forks":2317,"open_issues":108,"watchers":10499,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"`vec1` type currently doesn't support the implicit construction and conversion between the underlying scalar type. this causes several template metaprogramming and semantic problems:\n\n1) they cannot be constructed by copy-list initializers, like other `vec` types\n\nalso mentioned in issue #252 \n\n```\ntemplate <class Vector>\nfloat func(Vector v);\n\nint main()\n{\n    func<glm::vec1>(1.0); // error, no implicit constructor\n    func<glm::vec1>({1.0}); // error, copy-list initialization cannot use an explicit constructor\n    func<glm::vec2>({1.0, 2.0}); // it's ok\n    func<glm::vec3>({1.0, 2.0, 3.0}); // it's ok\n    func<glm::vec4>({1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0}); // it's ok\n}\n```\n\n2) they represent the degenerate 1-dimensional (scalar) case, they support arithmetic operations with scalar types, yet they cannot be assigned from/to fundamental scalar types. this is semantically incorrect.\n\n```\nusing float1 = glm::vec1;\n\nfloat1 x(1.0f);\nfloat1 y = x + 3.0f; // it's ok, operations with scalar types are supported\n\nfloat s = 1.0f;\nfloat1 z = s; // error, no copy assignment for underlying scalar type\ns = static_cast<float>(z); // error, no conversion operator for underlying scalar type\n```\n\n3) issue #431 \n\nfixing this issue automatically fixes issue #431 \nthe vec1 versions of length() and length2() will automatically accept scalar types\n\n---\n\nThe issues can be fixed easily by removing the explicit keyword from the main constructor, and adding an implicit conversion operator. I will create a pull request soon.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/442/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"i